== no_text
error[Z0406]: `annotate` needs `text`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:4:3
  |
4 | p.annotate(x: 2, y: 1)
  |   ^^^^^^^^ `text` is missing
  |
  = help: an annotation is a text and the place it is written at, as in `annotate(text: "policy change", x: 2015, y: 40)`

