== a_number_on_dates
error[Z0401]: `x:` of `annotate` is an Int, but the `x` axis of this plot holds the dates of `day`
 --> scripts/main.zeff:4:61
  |
4 | d.plot(x: day, y: change).lines().annotate(text: "here", x: 3, y: 1)
  |                                                             ^ no place on this axis
