== an_annotation_of_a_frame
error[Z0401]: `annotate` cannot be called on a Frame
 --> scripts/main.zeff:4:1
  |
4 | d.annotate(text: "here", x: 2, y: 1)
  | ^ this is a Frame
  |
  = help: `annotate` takes a Plot first; `x.annotate(...)` is `annotate(x, ...)`
